---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Container from '../../components/layout/Container.astro';
import Header from '../../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/layout/Footer.astro';
import H1 from '../../components/typography/H1.astro';
import H2 from '../../components/typography/H2.astro';
import P from '../../components/typography/P.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/layout/Breadcrumb.astro';
import BreadcrumbSchema from '../../components/seo/BreadcrumbSchema.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Privacy Policy | Megaways Online';
const pageDescription =
	'How Megaways Online handles your data: no accounts, no cookies, cookieless aggregate analytics, a theme preference stored on your device, standard hosting logs, and third-party demo games that load only when you choose to play them.';

const breadcrumbItems = [
	{ label: 'Home', href: '/' },
	{ label: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy/' },
];

const lastUpdated = '2026-07-14';

const linkClass = 'underline hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-primary-400';
---

<PageLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
	<BreadcrumbSchema items={breadcrumbItems} />
	<Header slot='header' />

	<Container>
		<Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbItems} class='mb-6' />

		<article class='max-w-3xl mb-16'>
			<header class='mb-10'>
				<H1 size='lg'>Privacy Policy</H1>
				<P class='text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					Last updated: <time datetime={lastUpdated}>14 July 2026</time>
				</P>
			</header>

			<!-- Layered summary (at a glance) -->
			<section class='mb-10 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 p-6'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>This policy at a glance</H2>
				<ul class='list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>
					<li>We have no accounts, forms, newsletters or advertising trackers. We use <strong>cookieless, aggregate-only analytics</strong> (Vercel Web Analytics) that cannot identify or follow you.</li>
					<li>We set <strong>no cookies</strong>. Your light/dark theme choice is saved on your own device and never sent to us.</li>
					<li>Our host (Vercel) keeps standard, short-lived server logs to run and protect the site.</li>
					<li>Free demo games are hosted by the game providers and load <strong>only if you click play</strong> — at that point the provider receives the technical data any website visit involves.</li>
					<li>Casino links are affiliate links; the casino's own privacy policy applies on their site. We never receive your personal details from them.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Who we are</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					Megaways Online (megawaysonline.com) is an independent informational website
					publishing reviews of online slot games and casinos, operated by Duwayne Cowney,
					who is the data controller for any personal data processed through this site. We
					do not operate gambling services and we do not process payments or wagers. For
					anything in this policy, contact
					<a href='mailto:hello@megawaysonline.com' class={linkClass}>hello@megawaysonline.com</a>.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>What we collect, why, and for how long</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4'>
					Very little. This site has no user accounts, no comment forms and no newsletter.
					We do not run advertising trackers, and we do not set cookies of any kind.
				</P>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4'>
					<strong>Site analytics.</strong> We use Vercel Web Analytics, a privacy-first,
					<strong>cookieless</strong> service, to understand aggregate site usage — page
					views, referrers, country and device type. It does not use cookies or local
					storage, does not track you across sites, and cannot identify you: visits are
					counted via a temporary hash that is discarded within 24 hours. Our legal basis
					is legitimate interest (understanding how the site is used). Details are in
					Vercel's
					<a href='https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy' rel='noopener' target='_blank' class={linkClass}>analytics privacy documentation</a>.
				</P>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4'>
					<strong>Theme preference.</strong> If you switch between light and dark mode,
					that choice is saved in your browser's local storage. It stays on your device, is
					not transmitted to us, and you can remove it at any time by clearing site data in
					your browser.
				</P>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4'>
					<strong>Search.</strong> The site search runs entirely in your browser: it
					downloads a static index of our page titles and matches your query locally. What
					you type is never sent to us or to anyone else.
				</P>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					<strong>Hosting logs.</strong> Our hosting provider (Vercel Inc.) records
					standard technical server logs — such as IP address, browser type and pages
					requested — which are needed to deliver the site and protect it from abuse. Our
					legal basis for this is legitimate interest (running a secure website). These
					logs are retained only briefly and are processed under Vercel's own
					<a href='https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy' rel='noopener' target='_blank' class={linkClass}>privacy policy</a>.
					We do not use them to identify or profile visitors.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Free demo games</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4'>
					Slot review pages offer free play-money demos. <strong>No demo content loads
					when you open the page.</strong> If you press &ldquo;Play Free Demo&rdquo;, your
					browser loads the game directly from the game provider's servers (for example
					Pragmatic Play, Red Tiger or Big Time Gaming). From that moment the provider
					receives the technical data involved in any web request — such as your IP
					address and device type — and may use cookies or similar technology
					<em>inside the game frame</em>, under that provider's own privacy policy.
				</P>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					We configure these embeds so that your browser does not tell the provider which
					of our pages you came from, and we receive no data about your demo play. If you
					prefer not to share anything with game providers, simply don't start a demo —
					every review is fully readable without one.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Casino links and third parties</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4'>
					Links to casinos on this site are affiliate links. If you follow one, the casino
					operator (and its tracking platform) may set cookies and collect data on their
					own sites under their own privacy policies — we encourage you to read them
					before registering. We receive aggregate referral statistics from these
					programmes, not your personal details.
				</P>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					All outbound links are sent with a no-referrer policy, meaning your browser does
					not tell the destination site which of our pages you came from.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>International transfers</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					Our hosting provider is a US company serving the site from a global network, so
					the technical log and aggregate analytics data described above may be processed
					outside the UK/EEA.
					Vercel applies the safeguards described in its
					<a href='https://vercel.com/legal/dpa' rel='noopener' target='_blank' class={linkClass}>data processing agreement</a>,
					including standard contractual clauses.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Your rights</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4'>
					As a South African operator we process personal information in line with the
					Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA). Depending on where you live,
					equivalent laws may also protect you — for example the UK GDPR, the EU GDPR or
					Canada's PIPEDA. Under these laws you have the right to access, correct, delete
					or receive a copy of personal data held about you, to restrict or object to its
					processing, and to withdraw any consent. Since we hold essentially no personal
					data, requests will usually be a short conversation — but email us and we will
					help, including passing requests to our hosting provider where relevant. We will
					respond within one month.
				</P>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					You also have the right to complain to a data protection authority — the
					<a href='https://inforegulator.org.za' rel='noopener' target='_blank' class={linkClass}>Information Regulator (South Africa)</a>,
					or your local authority such as the
					<a href='https://ico.org.uk' rel='noopener' target='_blank' class={linkClass}>ICO</a>
					in the UK or the
					<a href='https://www.priv.gc.ca' rel='noopener' target='_blank' class={linkClass}>Office of the Privacy Commissioner</a>
					in Canada.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-10'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Age restriction</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					This site is intended for adults aged 18 and over. We do not knowingly collect
					any information from minors, and our content is not directed at them.
				</P>
			</section>

			<section class='mb-0'>
				<H2 size='sm' class='mb-3'>Changes to this policy</H2>
				<P class='text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-0'>
					If we add features that change how data is handled, this policy will be updated
					first and the date above revised. Significant changes will be noted on this
					page.
				</P>
			</section>
		</article>
	</Container>

	<Footer slot='footer' />
</PageLayout>
